Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:55.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, fight！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:58.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  开怀欢笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:00.68,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:01.57,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.56,0:02:09.85,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:12.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:14.94,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:22.12,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:26.29,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:31.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:31.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:35.71,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.54,0:02:34.91,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:35.57,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:36.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:41.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:40.40,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.05,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.45,0:02:42.29,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:46.81,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:50.23,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:52.11,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.02,0:02:53.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:56.06,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:55.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.62,0:02:59.00,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:58.82,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:01.68,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.28,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.45,0:03:04.03,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:06.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Smile go go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:07.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:08.48,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
