Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:19.60,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.86,0:22:22.44,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:26.17,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.82,0:22:28.65,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yeah~！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.25,0:22:39.08,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,像椰子和果仁那般
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:41.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,柔軟甜美的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.25,0:22:45.06,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,沉醉其中时
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.06,0:22:47.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.38,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,得把窗帘打开
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.89,0:22:53.39,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,去寻找梦的续集
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:57.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,希望那灿烂的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.27,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,不要把我的心溶化
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:00.60,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Oh～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:06.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,太阳公公的表情多么开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.60,0:23:12.36,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为何可以笑得这么开怀!?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.58,0:23:18.21,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,其实我的心情也是同样明亮的 color
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:23.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,闪闪发亮吧 My True Love！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:28.26,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想要做梦 想要恋爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:31.05,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想做很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:33.43,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,微笑就是咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.14,0:23:36.68,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,最棒！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.68,0:23:40.02,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pre pre precure·Five☆
